{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>For</b> — The entire desire of Your servants is to see her stones, and as it were her dust would show them favor, to kiss it. And Rabbi Moses said: <b>they favor</b> is like <b>then the earth shall favor</b> [Isaiah?]; <b>and her dust</b>, to rebuild her when the appointed time comes, in the manner of <b>they showed them favor</b> [Exodus 12:36]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 102, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:49.526360158Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}